+## UNRELEASED
+
+- **Fix: tools added or removed during a turn reach Claude Code in that turn** — When a tool registers or unregisters tools (or an MCP server) while it runs, the waiting Claude Code query is replaced by one that resumes the session and serves the current tools, instead of keeping the old set until the next prompt.
+
